## Summary Table

| Input Type | Confidence | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Fully matched (lane + metric + time/scope if present) | High | Execute |
| Minor ambiguity or bounded repair needed | Medium | Repair or cautious execute |
| Missing info or unclear intent | Low | Clarify |
| Blocked partner/service change | Low | Guardrail / clarify |

